From: starlight071986 <113560659+starlight071986@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 23:56:38 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] api: add /api/box/cmd REST endpoint

MQTT_CONTROL.md documents GET /api/box/cmd?boxId=&cmd=&value= but the
route was never registered. Implemented in a separate file to keep the
patch small when rebasing onto new upstream releases.

No own authentication: like every other /api route it relies on the
web port being protected (e.g. reverse proxy with auth).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
